  "method": "ISO 14125:1998 method B (four-point), class III: span 45 mm, loading span 15 mm. testXpert III's 'Verformung' is the crosshead travel (identical to 'Traversenweg' in every file), which moves the loading points; its strains reproduce only when deflection is taken at the loading points. Regression modulus between 0.05 % and 0.25 % strain, strain counted from the recorded zero after a 0.1 N preload.",
